priority_id.description:
New priority identifier. Must be one of the priorities configured for the project;
the ids in use are returned as `priority_id` on any feedback item.

Set to `null` to remove the priority.

type_id.description:
New type identifier. Must be one of the types configured for the project;
the ids in use are returned as `type_id` on any feedback item.

Set to `null` to remove the type.

TagFilter.description:
Repeatable filter (e.g. `tag[]=bug&tag[]=ux` or `tag[]=<uuid>`). Each value is combined with **OR**;
results include feedback that has at least one of the matching tags. Values are tag names or tag UUIDs (RFC 4122)
for the project's team. Unknown names and UUIDs with no matching tag are ignored; if none resolve, the list is empty.
